title: Presidential Election 1934
subtitle: After Hindenburg's death, a new presidential election is called.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: hindenburg_dead == 1 and not presidential_election_1934_done
on-arrival: {!
Q.presidential_election_1934_phase = 1;
// Determine candidates based on faction state and political landscape
// NSDAP candidate
if (!Q.hitler_deported && Q.hitler_citizen) {
    Q.nsdap_candidate_1934 = "Hitler";
    Q.nsdap_candidate_1934_disp = "Adolf Hitler";
} else {
    Q.nsdap_candidate_1934 = "Göring";
    Q.nsdap_candidate_1934_disp = "Hermann Göring";
}

// KPD candidate - Thälmann banned per spec §8.4
Q.communist_candidate_1934 = "Thälmann_banned";
Q.communist_candidate_1934_disp = "Ernst Thälmann (banned)";

// SPD candidate
Q.spd_candidate_1934 = "Braun";
Q.spd_candidate_1934_disp = "Otto Braun";

// Zentrum candidate selection based on faction strength
if (Q.christian_unity_strength >= 40 && Q.cdu_formed == 0) {
    Q.z_candidate_1934 = "Adenauer";
    Q.z_candidate_1934_disp = "Konrad Adenauer (CDU)";
} else if (Q.stegerwald_path == 1 || Q.christian_unity_strength >= 30) {
    Q.z_candidate_1934 = "Stegerwald";
    Q.z_candidate_1934_disp = "Adam Stegerwald";
} else if (Q.center_strength >= 30) {
    Q.z_candidate_1934 = "Marx";
    Q.z_candidate_1934_disp = "Wilhelm Marx";
} else if (Q.right_strength >= 30) {
    Q.z_candidate_1934 = "Kaas";
    Q.z_candidate_1934_disp = "Ludwig Kaas";
} else {
    Q.z_candidate_1934 = "Marx";
    Q.z_candidate_1934_disp = "Wilhelm Marx";
}

// Eckener candidacy - spec §8.3: anger threshold if dnvp_relation > 40 or nsdap_relation > 10
if (Q.dnvp_relation <= 40 && Q.nsdap_relation <= 10 && Q.pro_republic >= 40) {
    Q.eckener_available_1934 = 1;
} else {
    Q.eckener_available_1934 = 0;
    Q.eckener_anger_reason = "";
    if (Q.dnvp_relation > 40) Q.eckener_anger_reason += "DNVP relations too high. ";
    if (Q.nsdap_relation > 10) Q.eckener_anger_reason += "NSDAP relations too high. ";
}

// Reactionary/Right candidate
if (Q.papen_recruited) {
    Q.reactionary_candidate_1934 = "Papen";
    Q.reactionary_candidate_1934_disp = "Franz von Papen";
} else if (Q.schleicher_recruited) {
    Q.reactionary_candidate_1934 = "Schleicher";
    Q.reactionary_candidate_1934_disp = "Kurt von Schleicher";
} else if (Q.kvp_formed) {
    Q.reactionary_candidate_1934 = "Hugenberg";
    Q.reactionary_candidate_1934_disp = "Alfred Hugenberg";
} else {
    Q.reactionary_candidate_1934 = "Duesterberg";
    Q.reactionary_candidate_1934_disp = "Theodor Duesterberg";
}

Q.presidential_election_1934_campaigning_seen = 1;
!}
priority: 1
max-visits: 1
go-to: election_1934_candidates

@election_1934

= Presidential Election 1934

Paul von Hindenburg has died. The Constitution requires a new presidential election within one month. The Republic faces its most critical test: will the presidency fall to a defender of democracy, or to its enemies?

The NSDAP runs [+ nsdap_candidate_1934_disp +]. The KPD would run Thälmann, but he is banned under the Reichstag Fire Decree. The SPD runs [+ spd_candidate_1934_disp +]. The Zentrum must choose its candidate: [+ z_candidate_1934_disp +].

[? if eckener_available_1934: Hugo Eckener, the Zeppelin pioneer and anti-Nazi nationalist, is available as a unity candidate. ?][? if not eckener_available_1934: Hugo Eckener declines to run: [+ eckener_anger_reason +] ?]

The Right runs [+ reactionary_candidate_1934_disp +].

@election_1934_candidates

- @view_1934_candidates: Review the candidates.

@view_1934_candidates
new-page: true

= The 1934 Candidates

[? if z_candidate_1934: <b>Zentrum:</b> [+ z_candidate_1934_disp +] ?]
[? if spd_candidate_1934: <b>SPD:</b> [+ spd_candidate_1934_disp +] ?]
[? if nsdap_candidate_1934: <b>NSDAP:</b> [+ nsdap_candidate_1934_disp +] ?]
[? if reactionary_candidate_1934: <b>Right:</b> [+ reactionary_candidate_1934_disp +] ?]
[? if eckener_available_1934: <b>Unity:</b> Hugo Eckener ?]

- @z_run_candidate: Run [+ z_candidate_1934_disp +] as Zentrum candidate.
- @z_support_spd: Support SPD candidate ([+ spd_candidate_1934_disp +]).
- @z_support_eckener: Support Hugo Eckener (unity candidate).
- @z_support_reactionary: Support Right candidate ([+ reactionary_candidate_1934_disp +]).
- @z_abstain: Abstain.

@z_run_candidate
subtitle: Costs 2 resources.
choose-if: resources >= 2
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 2;
Q.z_campaign_1934 = 1;
Q.presidential_opinion += 2;
if (Q.presidential_opinion > 100) Q.presidential_opinion = 100;
!}
go-to: election_1934_result

The Zentrum campaigns for [+ z_candidate_1934_disp +]. The party mobilizes its Catholic base.

@z_support_spd
on-arrival: {!
Q.z_support_spd_1934 = 1;
Q.left_dissent += 5;
Q.anti_fascist_dissent -= 3;
Q.presidential_opinion -= 3;
if (Q.presidential_opinion < 0) Q.presidential_opinion = 0;
!}
go-to: election_1934_result

The Zentrum endorses the SPD's [+ spd_candidate_1934_disp +]. Left and Anti-Fascist factions approve. Hindenburg's circle (and the Right) are displeased.

@z_support_eckener
choose-if: eckener_available_1934 == 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.z_support_eckener_1934 = 1;
Q.center_strength += 3;
Q.christian_unity_strength += 2;
Q.anti_fascist_strength += 2;
Q.presidential_opinion += 1;
if (Q.presidential_opinion > 100) Q.presidential_opinion = 100;
!}
unavailable-subtitle: Eckener is not running.
go-to: election_1934_result

The Zentrum backs Hugo Eckener as a unity candidate. Center, Christian Unity, and Anti-Fascist factions are strengthened.

@z_support_reactionary
on-arrival: {!
Q.z_support_reactionary_1934 = 1;
Q.right_strength += 5;
Q.barons_strength += 3;
Q.left_dissent += 10;
Q.anti_fascist_dissent += 10;
Q.presidential_opinion += 5;
if (Q.presidential_opinion > 100) Q.presidential_opinion = 100;
!}
go-to: election_1934_result

The Zentrum supports the Right's candidate [+ reactionary_candidate_1934_disp +]. Right and Barons factions gain strength. Left and Anti-Fascists are outraged.

@z_abstain
on-arrival: {!
Q.z_abstain_1934 = 1;
Q.left_dissent += 5;
Q.center_dissent += 5;
Q.right_dissent += 5;
Q.presidential_opinion -= 2;
if (Q.presidential_opinion < 0) Q.presidential_opinion = 0;
!}
go-to: election_1934_result

The Zentrum abstains. All factions are displeased. The Right is mildly relieved.

@election_1934_result
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.presidential_election_1934_done = 1;
// Simplified election resolution
var z_vote = Q.z_votes || 12;
var spd_vote = Q.spd_votes || 21;
var kpd_vote = Q.kpd_votes || 13;
var nsdap_vote = Q.nsdap_votes || 33;
var right_vote = Q.dnvp_votes + Q.dvp_votes + Q.kvp_votes + Q.other_votes || 10;

// Center/liberal vote split
var center_vote = Q.ddp_votes + Q.lvp_votes || 4;
var bvp_vote = Q.bvp_votes || 3;

// Calculate based on endorsements
var z_support = z_vote;
var spd_support = spd_vote;
var nsdap_support = nsdap_vote;
var right_support = right_vote;

if (Q.z_campaign_1934) {
    z_support += center_vote * 0.5 + bvp_vote * 0.7;
} else if (Q.z_support_spd_1934) {
    spd_support += z_vote * 0.3;
} else if (Q.z_support_eckener_1934) {
    // Eckener draws from center, liberals, some right
    z_support += center_vote * 0.3 + bvp_vote * 0.3;
    right_support += center_vote * 0.2;
} else if (Q.z_support_reactionary_1934) {
    right_support += z_vote * 0.6 + center_vote * 0.3;
} else {
    // Abstain - votes scatter
    spd_support += z_vote * 0.1;
    right_support += z_vote * 0.1;
}

// SPD/KPD dynamics
if (Q.kpd_relation >= 50 && !Q.z_support_spd_1934) {
    spd_support += kpd_vote * 0.3;
} else {
    // KPD voters split: some to SPD, some abstain
    spd_support += kpd_vote * 0.1;
}

// Determine winner (round 1 - 50% needed)
var total = z_support + spd_support + nsdap_support + right_support;
var winner = "";
var runoff = 0;

if (nsdap_support / total >= 0.5) { winner = "NSDAP"; }
else if (spd_support / total >= 0.5) { winner = "SPD"; }
else if (z_support / total >= 0.5) { winner = "Zentrum"; }
else if (right_support / total >= 0.5) { winner = "Right"; }
else { runoff = 1; }

Q.election_1934_winner = winner;
Q.election_1934_runoff = runoff;
Q.election_1934_z_pct = Math.round(z_support / total * 100);
Q.election_1934_spd_pct = Math.round(spd_support / total * 100);
Q.election_1934_nsdap_pct = Math.round(nsdap_support / total * 100);
Q.election_1934_right_pct = Math.round(right_support / total * 100);
!}

